---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About FinFormat — Independent Client-Side Financial Engineering"
  description="About FinFormat, an independent client-side financial software suite engineered for US CPAs, bookkeepers, and small businesses."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <div class="site-container" style="padding-top: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px); padding-bottom: 72px;">
    
    <section style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <span class="badge-lime" style="margin-bottom: 12px; display: inline-flex;">INDEPENDENT UTILITY</span>
      <h1 class="display-lg" style="max-width: 900px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        About FinFormat
      </h1>
      <p class="body-lg" style="max-width: 780px; color: #404040;">
        FinFormat was created to solve a persistent frustration in American small business accounting: banks export messy spreadsheets, accounting systems lock users out with format errors, and legacy converter tools charge exorbitant monthly subscriptions for basic file transformations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="bezel-tray" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <div class="bezel-core">
        <h2 class="card-title" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Our Guiding Engineering Principles</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 20px;">
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;">Zero Server Telemetry</h3>
            <p class="body-sm" style="color: #525252;">
              Financial data belongs to the business owner, not our servers. Everything parses client-side in your browser's local RAM.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;">Strict Spec Compliance</h3>
            <p class="body-sm" style="color: #525252;">
              From balanced double-entry IIF math to 32-character OL-222 sanitization, we adhere to exact banking format specifications.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;">No Artificial Limits</h3>
            <p class="body-sm" style="color: #525252;">
              No 3-file daily caps, no row limits, and no registration walls. FinFormat is designed for fast, frictionless utility.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
